<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Jihoceska sees '96 net profit down.</title>
<headline>Czech Jihoceska sees '96 net profit down.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech regional power utility Jihoceska Energetika a.s. said on Thursday it expected to post a net profit for 1996 of 170 to 180 million crowns, compared with 256 million in 1995.</p>
</text>
